      <div class="divider"></div>
      <p style="color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">Started in 2010 in the heart of Ahmedabad, Mayur Restaurant was born from a passion for preserving the rich culinary heritage of India. Our chefs bring generations of knowledge to every dish they prepare.</p>
      <p style="color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.8;">From the finest spices sourced directly from Indian farms to the traditional slow-cooking methods — every detail is crafted to give you an unforgettable dining experience.</p>
      <div class="about-stats">
        <div class="stat-box"><div class="num">15+</div><div class="lbl">Years of Excellence</div></div>
        <div class="stat-box"><div class="num">200+</div><div class="lbl">Dishes on Menu</div></div>
        <div class="stat-box"><div class="num">50k+</div><div class="lbl">Happy Customers</div></div>
        <div class="stat-box"><div class="num">4.8★</div><div class="lbl">Google Rating</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>

<!-- ══════════════ MENU SECTION ══════════════ -->
<div id="menu-section" class="page-section">
